WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:00.030
<b>Summary of previous episodes</b>

00:00:01.570 --> 00:00:05.900
<i>Last time on </i>Frankenstein Family<i>:</i>

00:00:07.410 --> 00:00:12.450
<i>All of a sudden, my family was gone.</i>

00:00:13.190 --> 00:00:15.140
<i>I walked around town,</i>

00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:16.570
<i>I talked to everyone I met,</i>

00:00:16.570 --> 00:00:18.620
<i>but I couldn't find them.</i>

00:00:20.230 --> 00:00:22.990
<i>Just then, I ran into Sumire-chan.</i>

00:00:22.990 --> 00:00:28.380
<i>And she made me realize that 
the way I'd been acting was wrong.</i>

00:00:30.310 --> 00:00:33.710
<i>My siblings were just fine the way they were.</i>

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:40.810
<i>The teacher managed to get us a boat, 
and we headed out onto the stormy sea.</i>

00:00:42.470 --> 00:00:44.980
<i>Kuma-san, you're willing 
to go with us?</i>

00:00:46.520 --> 00:00:50.120
<i>Huh? Can you drive a boat, ma'am?</i>

00:01:16.930 --> 00:01:18.930
<b>Frankenstein Family</b>

00:02:38.320 --> 00:02:43.280
<b>#12: Frankenstein Family</b>

00:02:42.950 --> 00:02:44.350
Hold on tight!

00:02:53.360 --> 00:02:54.360
Tanisu-kun!

00:02:56.500 --> 00:02:57.800
You okay?

00:02:59.360 --> 00:03:01.360
Yes. Thank you...

00:03:01.810 --> 00:03:03.530
There we go.

00:03:03.530 --> 00:03:05.910
This should be easier on us.

00:03:05.910 --> 00:03:07.870
Why did you come with me?

00:03:10.330 --> 00:03:12.440
This is all my fault.

00:03:12.440 --> 00:03:15.880
But I've ended up having to ask
 people for so much help...

00:03:16.410 --> 00:03:18.410
And you've actually helped me...

00:03:18.410 --> 00:03:20.310
Hey, it's fine.

00:03:21.670 --> 00:03:24.630
No one can live all by themselves.

00:03:24.630 --> 00:03:28.990
That's why you have friends, 
loved ones, and family.

00:03:29.490 --> 00:03:30.840
Family...

00:03:30.840 --> 00:03:33.400
We're not related by blood.

00:03:33.400 --> 00:03:37.850
But if I could, I'd like to 
be a part of your family.

00:03:38.400 --> 00:03:42.510
Some old friends taught 
me that a long time ago.

00:03:46.160 --> 00:03:47.660
Hold on tight!

00:03:48.580 --> 00:03:49.660
Thank you!

00:03:53.860 --> 00:03:55.540
We're here!

00:03:55.540 --> 00:03:57.630
Boy, that was close!

00:04:00.790 --> 00:04:01.590
Is that...

00:04:08.290 --> 00:04:09.700
It's still wet.

00:04:09.700 --> 00:04:11.530
They can't have been here long...

00:04:11.530 --> 00:04:12.100
Tanisu-kun.

00:04:13.780 --> 00:04:16.110
Go do what you came here for.

00:04:17.480 --> 00:04:18.540
Okay!

00:04:21.940 --> 00:04:24.110
Not going with him?

00:04:25.330 --> 00:04:27.620
I'm sure he'll come back.

00:04:28.290 --> 00:04:30.620
Because you're family, is that it?

00:05:00.100 --> 00:05:01.470
<i>Which way was it?</i>

00:05:24.520 --> 00:05:25.590
<i>Okay...</i>

00:05:36.480 --> 00:05:40.030
<i>It would be easy with my sisters' abilities,</i>

00:05:40.030 --> 00:05:41.950
<i>but I can't jump that far...</i>

00:05:48.490 --> 00:05:49.950
<i>That was close!</i>

00:05:49.950 --> 00:05:52.490
<i>Is there anything I can use?</i>

00:05:52.490 --> 00:05:53.610
<i>How about that?</i>

00:06:07.250 --> 00:06:08.760
This is what I needed.

00:06:24.530 --> 00:06:26.030
Almost there...

00:06:35.620 --> 00:06:38.570
<i>It's such a simple thing, and yet...</i>

00:06:39.690 --> 00:06:42.110
<i>I should have told them earlier.</i>

00:06:42.110 --> 00:06:45.960
<i>All I had to do was talk to them, but...</i>

00:07:07.610 --> 00:07:10.670
Snow-niisan!

00:07:13.610 --> 00:07:14.990
Tanisu?

00:07:19.750 --> 00:07:21.580
Let's go home together.

00:07:26.420 --> 00:07:28.590
Our home is here.

00:07:29.000 --> 00:07:30.090
Why?

00:07:31.030 --> 00:07:33.430
Because we're monsters.

00:07:34.010 --> 00:07:37.220
We can't live among humans, right?

00:07:37.220 --> 00:07:39.670
You won't know until you try.

00:07:40.530 --> 00:07:43.570
I'm making medicine that 
will turn you all human...

00:07:43.570 --> 00:07:46.360
So hang in just a little bit longer!

00:07:46.360 --> 00:07:48.440
How long are we supposed to wait?

00:07:48.440 --> 00:07:51.670
Until next year? Ten years?

00:07:51.670 --> 00:07:56.510
If someone finds us before then, 
how will you protect us?

00:08:02.660 --> 00:08:06.510
Tanisu. You don't understand 
the real problem.

00:08:06.510 --> 00:08:07.880
I do!

00:08:07.880 --> 00:08:10.140
No, you don't. We're—

00:08:10.140 --> 00:08:15.340
Aisuri-neesan, you've never thought there 
was anything wrong with the way you are.

00:08:15.340 --> 00:08:19.310
Ashisu-neesan, you just don't want
 any involvement with humans.

00:08:19.860 --> 00:08:21.520
Suishi-neesan, too...

00:08:21.520 --> 00:08:26.520
you also think humans are shady creatures 
who lose their minds over any little thing.

00:08:27.700 --> 00:08:31.950
Maybe I can't fix all that the way I am now.

00:08:31.950 --> 00:08:36.800
I don't know how to let you coexist 
with the other humans, either.

00:08:36.800 --> 00:08:37.980
But...

00:08:40.810 --> 00:08:42.030
But...

00:08:42.680 --> 00:08:46.740
That's no reason for you to leave me behind!

00:08:46.740 --> 00:08:53.090
Does that mean you think of me the 
same way you do any other human?!

00:08:56.370 --> 00:08:57.470
Yes.

00:09:03.480 --> 00:09:05.330
You are human.

00:09:05.330 --> 00:09:07.440
We are monsters.

00:09:08.690 --> 00:09:10.860
Humans live in the city.

00:09:10.860 --> 00:09:14.400
Monsters are locked up 
in dark, cramped places.

00:09:14.400 --> 00:09:17.450
This is the lifestyle that suits us both.

00:09:17.450 --> 00:09:20.060
What are you basing that on?

00:09:20.060 --> 00:09:22.040
That can't be right!

00:09:23.140 --> 00:09:28.380
I've been working hard all 
this time, all for you guys!

00:09:30.840 --> 00:09:34.340
Monsters sometimes eat humans!

00:09:40.300 --> 00:09:44.190
If, some day, our identities get out,

00:09:44.190 --> 00:09:48.780
you may even lose your dreams,
 and all the people you love.

00:09:48.780 --> 00:09:52.890
The people who trusted you. 
The people who came to love you.

00:09:52.890 --> 00:09:57.430
They'll think of you as someone 
who protected monsters, and...

00:09:58.840 --> 00:10:03.240
That's the nature of the humans,
 who made us monsters to begin with.

00:10:06.810 --> 00:10:10.250
Maybe Mom and Dad modified us this way

00:10:10.980 --> 00:10:16.720
so that we wouldn't become 
that other kind of monster.

00:10:19.130 --> 00:10:20.890
I don't get it.

00:10:20.890 --> 00:10:24.390
You might be right, Snow-niisan.

00:10:24.390 --> 00:10:28.090
But there's still so much we don't know...

00:10:28.090 --> 00:10:30.020
Go back to human society.

00:10:30.020 --> 00:10:32.750
You can find your answers there.

00:10:34.340 --> 00:10:36.440
Then you guys are just right all the time?

00:10:39.450 --> 00:10:45.010
You've never acted selfishly and 
thoughtlessly like humans do?!

00:10:45.010 --> 00:10:46.240
We...

00:10:47.220 --> 00:10:50.360
You're all being pretty selfish, too!

00:10:51.190 --> 00:10:56.250
Have you ever thought how <i>I</i> would feel 
if you ran away without telling me?!

00:10:56.250 --> 00:10:57.710
It's for <i>my </i>benefit, you say?

00:10:58.950 --> 00:11:01.530
Humans can't coexist with monsters?

00:11:01.530 --> 00:11:03.660
That's all an excuse!

00:11:03.660 --> 00:11:08.290
<i>You're</i> the ones who don't know what to do,

00:11:08.290 --> 00:11:11.370
so you're following your instincts 
to retreat to the mountains!

00:11:12.870 --> 00:11:15.190
We're a special family!

00:11:15.190 --> 00:11:20.650
That's why we have to work 
together to find our answers!

00:11:20.650 --> 00:11:22.250
You're wrong.

00:11:22.250 --> 00:11:24.910
Humans and monsters can't ever...

00:11:27.960 --> 00:11:31.750
If there's something else we need, 
we can look for it after we go home!

00:12:01.810 --> 00:12:05.570
Then answer me one last question!

00:12:12.500 --> 00:12:16.110
I want to know how Snow-niisan really feels.

00:12:17.750 --> 00:12:19.000
Snow-niisan!

00:12:20.500 --> 00:12:23.950
How do you <i>really</i> want to live?!

00:12:45.290 --> 00:12:46.510
I...

00:12:48.170 --> 00:12:49.260
I...

00:12:50.730 --> 00:12:55.770
I want to live together with 
you and everyone forever!

00:13:01.670 --> 00:13:05.040
<i>That's right. We don't need a reason.</i>

00:13:05.040 --> 00:13:07.530
<i>It doesn't matter if we don't have an answer.</i>

00:13:07.530 --> 00:13:12.730
<i>We just want to make a life 
with the family we love.</i>

00:13:12.730 --> 00:13:13.880
<i>Because I am...</i>

00:13:13.880 --> 00:13:15.060
<i>And I am...</i>

00:13:15.060 --> 00:13:16.100
<i>And I am...</i>

00:13:16.100 --> 00:13:17.130
<i>And I am...</i>

00:13:17.130 --> 00:13:18.630
<i>We are all...</i>

00:13:18.630 --> 00:13:21.530
<i>part of the Frankenstein Family.</i>

00:13:47.960 --> 00:13:50.140
What is this? There's so much...

00:13:50.140 --> 00:13:51.720
This is called poon choi!

00:13:52.160 --> 00:13:54.700
It's a thing you eat with the whole family.

00:14:04.100 --> 00:14:05.650
It's delicious!

00:14:17.620 --> 00:14:19.050
That was great!

00:14:19.050 --> 00:14:21.650
Human food really is the best.

00:14:21.650 --> 00:14:23.620
Way tastier than cockroaches!

00:14:23.620 --> 00:14:25.640
This water is delicious!

00:14:25.640 --> 00:14:29.270
I'll grow a lot of great 
mushrooms based on this!

00:14:29.270 --> 00:14:33.600
No, puppy! You can't come out now!

00:14:39.250 --> 00:14:43.180
I'd like to ask your opinions about something.

00:14:43.180 --> 00:14:44.440
What is it?

00:14:45.190 --> 00:14:46.910
It comes with a serious risk.

00:14:47.650 --> 00:14:49.770
A risk of what?

00:14:50.660 --> 00:14:54.660
Let's tell Kuma-san about ourselves.

00:14:57.170 --> 00:15:00.270
I don't think we can hide it much longer.

00:15:00.270 --> 00:15:01.920
Hide what?

00:15:10.170 --> 00:15:11.800
Nothing!

00:15:11.800 --> 00:15:13.140
If...

00:15:13.140 --> 00:15:17.920
If we were hiding something, 
could you still stay with us?

00:15:17.920 --> 00:15:20.490
<i>Even Suishi's talking to me...</i>

00:15:20.490 --> 00:15:23.350
<i>If they're hiding something...</i>

00:15:24.490 --> 00:15:29.590
Well, everyone has a secret or 
two they don't want to tell!

00:15:29.590 --> 00:15:31.190
You do! I do!

00:15:31.190 --> 00:15:33.160
So I guess we have a lot in common!

00:15:37.160 --> 00:15:41.160
That is, just as long 
as it's nothing illegal!

00:15:43.160 --> 00:15:45.670
<i>Can we tell him, do you think?</i>

00:15:45.670 --> 00:15:49.160
Hey, are you really hiding something?

00:15:50.250 --> 00:15:53.080
Did you break something?

00:15:53.080 --> 00:15:54.810
If that's it, you should tell me!

00:15:54.810 --> 00:15:56.860
I'll have to take it to get fixed—

00:15:56.860 --> 00:15:58.150
Not about that!

00:15:58.580 --> 00:16:02.140
What we're hiding... is about our family!

00:16:08.150 --> 00:16:12.290
<i>Can it be... Are they connected to Yu-chan?</i>

00:16:12.290 --> 00:16:15.560
<i>It couldn't be... but maybe it could?</i>

00:16:16.260 --> 00:16:18.460
<i>Is that why they're all here?</i>

00:16:18.460 --> 00:16:21.350
<i>But it couldn't be anything 
this convenient, right?</i>

00:16:21.350 --> 00:16:24.050
<i>Damn, I'm getting nervous.</i>

00:16:24.050 --> 00:16:27.390
<i>The moment I've been waiting 
for has finally arrived...</i>

00:16:27.390 --> 00:16:30.310
<i>Now that I think about it, I can't 
believe I didn't think of it.</i>

00:16:30.310 --> 00:16:34.870
<i>If it's connected to Yu-chan... that's all 
the more reason I can't let this slip by.</i>

00:16:34.870 --> 00:16:37.540
If if it's a single ray of hope,
 there's still a chance!

00:16:37.540 --> 00:16:40.120
<i>I'm glad I didn't give up! Ema will be so happy!</i>

00:16:38.070 --> 00:16:40.120
<i>Wait, don't leap to conclusions.</i>

00:16:40.120 --> 00:16:42.080
<i>It might be totally unrelated!</i>

00:16:42.080 --> 00:16:43.230
Shut the hell up!

00:16:46.260 --> 00:16:47.230
Suishi?

00:16:47.230 --> 00:16:49.880
Who is this "Yu" person?

00:16:49.880 --> 00:16:51.080
Suishi!

00:16:51.940 --> 00:16:57.950
<b>Frankenstein Extras!</b>

00:16:53.010 --> 00:16:54.860
<i>Frankenstein Extras!</i>

00:16:55.970 --> 00:16:57.340
<i>Today's theme is...</i>

00:16:55.970 --> 00:16:57.950
<b>Today's theme is...</b>

00:16:57.950 --> 00:16:59.300
Here.

00:16:59.300 --> 00:17:00.200
Ta-da!

00:17:00.200 --> 00:17:03.370
Tell us some memories from your time recording.

00:17:03.370 --> 00:17:05.240
Hmm...

00:17:03.600 --> 00:17:08.570
<b>Tell us some memories
 from your time recording.</b>

00:17:05.240 --> 00:17:06.220
Let's see.

00:17:06.220 --> 00:17:07.900
Good memories, huh?

00:17:08.630 --> 00:17:13.630
A lot of delightful things have 
happened during this whole process.

00:17:09.060 --> 00:17:17.320
<b>Ashisu
 Hayami Saori</b>

00:17:14.200 --> 00:17:19.050
The double act between Ashisu and Aisuri.

00:17:19.050 --> 00:17:25.210
They cover for each other. They have a lot 
of lines where they fill in for each other.

00:17:25.210 --> 00:17:30.240
They shout "hooray hooray" together, 
talk to "Mama" together...

00:17:30.240 --> 00:17:33.740
They have a lot of lines 
we have to say together.

00:17:34.420 --> 00:17:35.910
Snow!

00:17:40.580 --> 00:17:42.160
Mama!

00:17:42.470 --> 00:17:44.500
Can you tell which is which?

00:17:46.120 --> 00:17:50.040
Oh, please. You're totally different.

00:17:50.040 --> 00:17:52.070
That's not true.

00:17:52.750 --> 00:17:55.510
Compare our hairstyles!

00:17:56.730 --> 00:17:59.010
Compare our eyes!

00:18:00.680 --> 00:18:03.180
Compare our shadows!

00:18:04.550 --> 00:18:09.400
Yes, the more you grow, 
the more alike you seem to look.

00:18:09.400 --> 00:18:13.420
We could have filmed a superhero movie 
about a spider-woman and a plant-woman.

00:18:14.760 --> 00:18:17.070
What's a movie?

00:18:17.860 --> 00:18:21.410
You don't need to know such things.

00:18:21.410 --> 00:18:24.860
Ever since that first came up,

00:18:24.860 --> 00:18:29.030
we were almost perfectly in sync, 
even in rehearsals.

00:18:29.960 --> 00:18:34.510
That made me really happy, personally.

00:18:46.470 --> 00:18:50.230
I want us to be the same.

00:18:58.240 --> 00:19:00.450
<i>To talk together.</i>

00:19:00.450 --> 00:19:02.320
<i>To eat together.</i>

00:19:02.640 --> 00:19:04.330
<i>To play together.</i>

00:19:04.330 --> 00:19:06.240
<i>To sleep together.</i>

00:19:06.240 --> 00:19:08.710
<i>Because...</i>

00:19:10.850 --> 00:19:13.050
<i>since the day we were born...</i>

00:19:13.050 --> 00:19:14.500
<i>we have always been together.</i>

00:19:15.940 --> 00:19:17.960
<i>Even if our powers are different,</i>

00:19:19.010 --> 00:19:21.890
<i>we know.</i>

00:19:21.890 --> 00:19:24.970
<i>We are the same!</i>

00:19:26.970 --> 00:19:31.480
No matter what you look 
like, you're still Aisuri.

00:19:51.920 --> 00:19:57.760
Even from the first episode, I've felt
 like we really were a family.

00:19:57.760 --> 00:20:00.760
It made me really happy.

00:20:00.760 --> 00:20:04.700
Hayami-san and I worked on
 a certain anime for little girls.

00:20:01.150 --> 00:20:04.680
<b>Aisuri
Mori Nanako</b>

00:20:01.150 --> 00:20:04.680
<b>Suishi
Ikuta Yoshiko</b>

00:20:01.150 --> 00:20:04.680
<b>Tanisu
Sugiyama Rie</b>

00:20:04.700 --> 00:20:06.440
Different generations of it, of course.

00:20:06.450 --> 00:20:09.070
But we got to work together.

00:20:09.100 --> 00:20:11.330
We were saying, "Ah, we meet again."

00:20:11.330 --> 00:20:14.190
"I guess I'm a plant again..." and such.

00:20:14.520 --> 00:20:16.950
You were a plant?

00:20:16.950 --> 00:20:18.230
It was perfect, huh?

00:20:18.230 --> 00:20:20.690
We talked about those things.

00:20:20.690 --> 00:20:23.690
And several times recording 
with Namikawa-san,

00:20:23.690 --> 00:20:26.580
this was a while back 
that we'd been together.

00:20:26.580 --> 00:20:30.960
I didn't think he'd remember me, but he did.

00:20:30.960 --> 00:20:32.620
Of course he did.

00:20:32.620 --> 00:20:34.890
He remembers a lot about everyone.

00:20:34.890 --> 00:20:38.020
I remember thinking he was so amazing.

00:20:38.020 --> 00:20:41.320
I was with Namikawa-san in my debut show.

00:20:41.320 --> 00:20:46.160
I didn't know anything 
about being a voice actor.

00:20:46.160 --> 00:20:50.470
So he's the one who taught me 
all about the mic and stuff.

00:20:50.470 --> 00:20:51.980
So nice!

00:20:51.980 --> 00:20:53.350
His stock is rising.

00:20:53.350 --> 00:20:55.710
Because of that,

00:20:55.710 --> 00:20:58.760
I think when he sees me talk into the mic, 
he's probably very impressed.

00:20:58.760 --> 00:21:00.560
Like a proud father?

00:21:00.560 --> 00:21:02.400
Yeah, I think so.

00:21:02.400 --> 00:21:06.200
He's watching over me like a father.

00:21:06.200 --> 00:21:09.830
It's nice to form those 
connections on the job.

00:21:10.890 --> 00:21:14.890
There are some people I was 
meeting for the first time.

00:21:11.810 --> 00:21:19.310
<b>Snow
Namikawa Daisuke</b>

00:21:14.890 --> 00:21:19.730
And of course people I've worked 
with many times before.

00:21:19.730 --> 00:21:25.370
Um... Sugiyama-san plays the main character.

00:21:26.490 --> 00:21:32.150
Um... should I say this? 
I'm not sure if I should.

00:21:32.150 --> 00:21:34.410
But she does great imitations.

00:21:35.350 --> 00:21:39.390
She hears a voice, and 
she doesn't realize it,

00:21:39.390 --> 00:21:45.360
I realized that she can 
imitate certain voices.

00:21:45.740 --> 00:21:47.170
So I had her do it.

00:21:47.170 --> 00:21:51.150
"Oh, this is... is it true? 
Do I sound the same?"

00:21:51.150 --> 00:21:53.620
And I said, "Say this line."

00:21:53.620 --> 00:21:55.500
and she did it perfectly.

00:21:55.520 --> 00:21:58.200
But we can't get her to perform it here.
(Because it is another show)

00:21:59.570 --> 00:22:05.400
I have a lot of memories like that, 
in the show we just did.

00:22:05.400 --> 00:22:11.130
I feel like our family had 
a nice recording together.

00:22:11.130 --> 00:22:14.630
Namikawa-san joined us 
in our second recording.

00:22:14.630 --> 00:22:16.850
But it's like his aura changed a lot.

00:22:16.850 --> 00:22:19.660
He was having a lot of fun, 
he was teasing us a lot.

00:22:19.660 --> 00:22:21.530
It was a lot of fun.

00:22:21.530 --> 00:22:26.940
He made me do imitations of 
totally different shows on site.

00:22:26.940 --> 00:22:30.130
Yes, he did! That's a great memory.

00:22:30.130 --> 00:22:34.420
After rehearsals ended and before 
we started recording,

00:22:34.420 --> 00:22:36.570
he made me do about two imitations.

00:22:36.570 --> 00:22:38.250
It really was perfect.

00:22:38.250 --> 00:22:40.410
He said you did a great imitation 
of a failure character

00:22:40.410 --> 00:22:42.170
from a certain family anime.

00:22:42.170 --> 00:22:43.190
Yes.

00:22:43.190 --> 00:22:44.750
You really do.

00:22:44.750 --> 00:22:46.490
I don't know. I really don't know.

00:22:46.490 --> 00:22:48.810
He made you do that one,

00:22:48.810 --> 00:22:51.420
then he said, "Do that one next."

00:22:52.470 --> 00:22:53.520
Was that an imitation?

00:22:53.520 --> 00:22:55.100
No! No!

00:22:55.100 --> 00:22:57.980
It wasn't malicious.

00:22:57.980 --> 00:22:58.980
You did sound like him, though.

00:22:58.980 --> 00:23:00.280
Yeah!

00:23:00.850 --> 00:23:04.890
But it's like we have a very 
soothing older sister,

00:23:04.890 --> 00:23:07.630
and a fun-loving older brother.

00:23:07.630 --> 00:23:08.720
Those two together.

00:23:08.720 --> 00:23:10.380
It was soothing?

00:23:10.380 --> 00:23:13.240
I was really nervous when we started,

00:23:13.240 --> 00:23:17.410
but I feel like they pulled me along.

00:23:17.410 --> 00:23:24.250
But that was true for everyone. 
The staff, the director, everyone.

00:23:24.250 --> 00:23:27.290
Everyone really had my back.

00:23:27.290 --> 00:23:30.750
It was a great recording.

00:23:31.170 --> 00:23:32.800
It was fun.

00:23:32.800 --> 00:23:34.410
That's a great story.

00:23:34.410 --> 00:23:35.540
Good!

00:23:35.540 --> 00:23:39.190
I thought it was really nice.
